<div class="vc-callout" id="returns-message" role="status">Loading return requests…</div>
<section class="vc-grid four mt-3" aria-label="Live returns summary"><article class="vc-card vc-stat"><span class="vc-stat-label">Needs vendor review</span><div class="vc-stat-value" id="returns-review-count">—</div></article><article class="vc-card vc-stat"><span class="vc-stat-label">Approved for return</span><div class="vc-stat-value" id="returns-approved-count">—</div></article><article class="vc-card vc-stat"><span class="vc-stat-label">Received for inspection</span><div class="vc-stat-value" id="returns-received-count">—</div></article><article class="vc-card vc-stat"><span class="vc-stat-label">Resolution recommended</span><div class="vc-stat-value" id="returns-resolution-count">—</div></article></section>
<section class="vc-card mt-3"><div class="vc-card-head"><div><h2>Repeated-return review</h2><span class="vc-help">Three requests from the same customer to your store in 30 days creates a human-review flag. It never rejects a return automatically.</span></div></div><div class="vc-card-body vc-list" id="returns-flags">Loading review flags…</div></section>
<section class="vc-card mt-3"><div class="vc-card-head"><div><h2>Customer return requests</h2><span class="vc-help">Review the request and clean-scanned evidence before making a decision.</span></div><button type="button" class="vc-btn small" id="returns-refresh">Refresh</button></div><div class="vc-table-wrap"><table class="vc-table"><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Product</th><th>Request</th><th>Reason</th><th>Requested</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="returns-rows"><tr><td colspan="7">Loading requests…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<dialog class="vc-dialog" id="returns-review-dialog" aria-labelledby="returns-review-title"><div class="vc-dialog-head"><h2 id="returns-review-title">Review return</h2><button type="button" class="vc-btn small" id="returns-close">Close</button></div><form class="vc-dialog-body" id="returns-decision-form"><div class="vc-info-row"><span>Order</span><strong id="returns-detail-order">—</strong></div><div class="vc-info-row"><span>Product</span><strong id="returns-detail-product">—</strong></div><div class="vc-info-row"><span>Request</span><strong id="returns-detail-type">—</strong></div><div class="vc-info-row"><span>Reason</span><strong id="returns-detail-reason">—</strong></div><p id="returns-detail-description" class="mt-3"></p><div class="vc-callout mt-3" id="returns-evidence">No evidence supplied.</div><div class="vc-field mt-3"><label for="returns-decision">Your decision</label><select class="vc-select" id="returns-decision" required></select></div><div class="vc-field mt-3"><label for="returns-note">Reason or inspection note</label><textarea class="vc-textarea" id="returns-note" minlength="10" maxlength="1000" required placeholder="Explain the decision for the customer and audit history."></textarea></div><div class="vc-callout warning mt-3">Approving a return does not book a courier. A refund recommendation does not send money; admin review and payment processing are separate.</div><div class="vc-form-actions"><button class="vc-btn primary" type="submit">Save decision</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog class="vc-dialog" id="returns-flag-dialog"><div class="vc-dialog-head"><h2>Record return-pattern context</h2><button class="vc-btn small" type="button" id="returns-flag-close">Close</button></div><form class="vc-dialog-body" id="returns-flag-form"><input type="hidden" name="flag_id"><p>Describe specific evidence or operational concerns. This note goes to admin review; it does not change return eligibility or customer account status.</p><div class="vc-field"><label>Vendor note</label><textarea class="vc-textarea" name="note" required minlength="20" maxlength="2000" rows="5"></textarea></div><div class="vc-form-actions"><button class="vc-btn primary" type="submit">Save note</button></div></form></dialog>
